WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.076 --> 00:00:10.544
In this walkthrough, we are going to work with slots. Add child widgets to container slots.

2
00:00:10.544 --> 00:00:12.948
This is useful because it shows the path through the admin interface before you need to do the same task on real content.

3
00:00:12.948 --> 00:00:14.792
Start in All Slots where the layout exposes named slots.

4
00:00:14.792 --> 00:00:17.478
Expand the Sidebar slot so the slot toolbar is visible.

5
00:00:17.478 --> 00:00:20.788
Click the plus icon on the Sidebar slot to add content exactly there.

6
00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:23.923
Choose a widget that belongs in the sidebar slot.

7
00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:27.370
Open the new widget settings so the sidebar content can be configured.

8
00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.737
By the end, you should know where to start, what to click, and what to check before you save or publish your work.
